Sat Nov 14 01:23:52 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add axene-rendertable.awk: with an Xft "*renderTable" in the user's
  X resources (as Motif 2.3 setups for anti-aliased text do), every
  label lost its text from the first Latin-1 accent or symbol on
  ("Authors: St", "XQuad" without "(R) - Spreadsheet", status bar
  without "(C)1995-2000 Axene."), since Motif draws Xft text as UTF-8,
  and the programs lost their own fonts. Each fontList in the
  app-defaults now has a matching <Class>*...renderTable, which binds
  more tightly than "*renderTable" and keeps the core iso8859-1 fonts.

